1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,016
Gallery Arcana is a private market for digital goods, powered by Zcash.

2
00:00:05,176 --> 00:00:08,118
This is the hosted demo: payments are simulated.

3
00:00:08,278 --> 00:00:10,302
Seal. Pay. Verify. Release.

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,276
Create an alias and a passphrase.

5
00:00:14,436 --> 00:00:15,850
No email or ID.

6
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,759
Your encryption keys are created in your browser.

7
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:23,531
Browse public previews and choose an Arcana Fragment.

8
00:00:23,691 --> 00:00:27,695
The original is an encrypted capsule, with a key sealed to its buyer.

9
00:00:27,855 --> 00:00:31,158
Sample sellers are automated. Payments are simulated.

10
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:35,824
Ask the seller a question through end-to-end encrypted chat.

11
00:00:35,984 --> 00:00:38,361
This sample seller replies automatically.

12
00:00:38,521 --> 00:00:41,420
The platform still processes financial offer amounts.

13
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:50,825
Checkout creates an exact ZEC amount, a single-use payment address, an invoice memo, and a ZIP three twenty-one request.

14
00:00:50,985 --> 00:00:54,607
The demo simulates this payment. No real ZEC moves.

15
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:58,960
The order is funded. The platform holds the funds in escrow.

16
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:02,614
The fallback is one hour, shortened to ten minutes in this demo.

17
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:07,187
Tap Decrypt locally and verify.

18
00:01:07,333 --> 00:01:11,621
The browser opens the sealed key and checks the file’s SHA two fifty-six.

19
00:01:11,767 --> 00:01:13,706
A match turns the order Paid instantly.

20
00:01:13,852 --> 00:01:19,670
Verifying is the acceptance. The seller’s payout is authorized, and a signed receipt records the sale.

21
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:24,031
If the buyer never opens the file, funds release after one hour.

22
00:01:24,183 --> 00:01:26,312
A fingerprint mismatch never releases.

23
00:01:26,465 --> 00:01:31,654
Disputes freeze funds; a reviewer decides within seven days: release or full refund.

24
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:37,517
In version one, the platform holds escrow funds and sees amounts and order metadata.

25
00:01:37,677 --> 00:01:42,173
Client-side encryption protects files, keys, chat and dispute evidence.

26
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:47,298
Now, real settlement evidence.

27
00:01:47,456 --> 00:01:54,418
The same purchase flow settled with real shielded transactions on real Zebra and Zallet, on local regtest.

28
00:01:54,576 --> 00:01:59,651
The committed evidence records the buyer payment, the seller payout, and verified: true.

29
00:01:59,809 --> 00:02:04,625
This is a private chain. Its coins have no value. It is not public testnet.

30
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:09,542
Regtest verified. Public testnet in progress. Mainnet disabled.

31
00:02:09,695 --> 00:02:12,863
Next: direct seller payments and viewing-key observation.

32
00:02:13,016 --> 00:02:14,653
Design only, not built.

33
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:16,396
Gallery Arcana.

34
00:02:16,556 --> 00:02:18,761
Built for ZECATHON. Private Markets.
